Title:  The drums don't speak that way

Seq:    5.7.20.1.1

Level:  6 - Subdetail

Class:  quote

Body:

At first it was one mike over the drums and a mike on the bass drum. Now they put a mike on everything. You can’t hardly start out from a whisper and go very loud. The drums just don’t speak that way when they’re miked really close.
